Subject: [PATCH 227/227] Meridian: first run finds Claude and sets the browser
 up with one Yes

The tour finds Claude Code, Codex and Claude Desktop, connects them on one
Yes and lets a CLI suggest the setup from space names and sites only. The
person agrees before anything changes and can undo it. It ends with three
things to try. Tests never see the real CLIs or Claude Desktop. Version 0.6.22.

